Subject: Exogenous variable effect coded (-1 / 1) possible in lavaan?
Message-ID: <7ujIfoYd_Bw.x2qxuW7nAQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/7ujIfoYd_Bw/m/x2qxuW7nAQAJ>
